    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Church\",\"hugel,159,113\")"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, to me, this {0} is rather like a place for old folks like me, you know...",
      "translation" : "嗯，在我看来，这个{0}就像是给我这样的老人准备的地方呢..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]",
      "translation" : "[胡格尔导游奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Pudding rather than praise.",
      "translation" : "与其受人称赞，不如吃布丁。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Inn\",\"hugel,101,77\")"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You'd better unpack your stuff at the {0} first before you start looking around this village.",
      "translation" : "开始逛村子之前，最好先把行李放在{0}。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]",
      "translation" : "[胡格尔导游奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Pub\",\"hugel,126,65\")"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, when you travel, you want to drop by a {0} and make new friends.",
      "translation" : "旅行时去{0}坐坐，结交新朋友，感觉真好。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go east from here, then you will arrive at the pub.",
      "translation" : "从这里往东走，就能到酒吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]",
      "translation" : "[胡格尔导游奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Airport\",\"hugel,178,146\")"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "A while ago, strangers came to the village and built that strange {0} kind of thing...",
      "translation" : "不久前，有些陌生人来到村里，建了个奇怪的{0}一样的东西..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What do they call it? Airship?",
      "translation" : "他们管那东西叫什么来着？飞艇？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]",
      "translation" : "[胡格尔导游奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Weapon Shop\",\"hugel,88,167\")"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, we have a {0} in the center of the village.",
      "translation" : "嗯，村子中心有一家{0}。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But I don't know if there is any weapon that you find useful.",
      "translation" : "不过我不知道里面有没有你觉得好用的武器。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]",
      "translation" : "[胡格尔导游奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, I love Hugel brand Red Potions. I haven't tasted Red Potions from any other brands yet...hohoho. ",
      "translation" : "是啊，我最喜欢胡格尔牌红色药水。我还没尝过其他牌子的红色药水呢...呵呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Tool Shop\",\"hugel,92,163\")"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The {0} is located in the center of village.",
      "translation" : "{0}位于村子中心。"
    },
